 t='1951 baseline for NRC in Manipur',
 ctx='The Manipur government told the Assembly that 1951 would be the proposed baseline for updating the NRC.',
 pts=['An NRC/NRIC needs the Union Government\'s authorisation. Section 14A of the Citizenship Act, 1955 empowers the Centre to register citizens and maintain the NRIC (Citizenship (Registration of Citizens and Issue of National Identity Cards) Rules).','Census (Census Act, 1948; Union List) counts the population. NPR records all usual residents, citizens and non-citizens. NRC contains only citizens after verification.'],
